---
export const prerender = true;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import LegalStatus from '../components/LegalStatus.astro';
---

<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Tokens & Wallet"
  description="What avaTOK tokens are, how top-ups convert into tokens, what they can be spent on, and what happens to a balance."
  image="/og/tokens.png"
  lead="Tokens are the in-app unit you use to pay for AI features and services on avaTOK."
  updated="2026-08-05"
  helpHref="/help/booking-and-paying/tokens-explained"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.421706b6f778cd51">This page explains how tokens and the in-app wallet work on avaTOK. It sits alongside our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-tokens.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, <a data-i18n="web-tokens.9990ef8acf0108bc" href="/refunds">Refunds &amp; Cancellations</a>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.6ff532f01420d686">policy,</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.aba115e7791e41dc" href="/payouts">Payouts &amp; Withdrawals</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.16047a3f9597e500">policy, and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-tokens.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.2c0560d6168d330b">page.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-tokens.518b95ed869bc13e">1 token equals the unit value shown at checkout.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.7c97397256cd794c">The rate is fixed for that
      transaction.
      Tokens you have not spent are</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-tokens.afd80519d959de87">not stuck in the app</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.d4cb066704b2f04c">— an unused balance can be
      withdrawn, subject to verification and to any transfer fee and tax shown before you confirm.
      See</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.aba115e7791e41dc" href="/payouts">Payouts &amp; Withdrawals</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.0922ebe046cfa13d" id="status">1. Who you are dealing with</h2>
  <LegalStatus variant="full" />
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.f0326893b21b615d">
    Your token balance is held by Ava Global International, Inc., a Delaware corporation. Because we
    are testing, balances are not a stored-value or payment instrument, are not open to the public,
    and test balances may be adjusted or reset while the product is in development.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.701b54d9e2db29c1">2. What a token is</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.d7cc124843c5d18a">A token is an in-app unit of account. It records how much service you are entitled to use on
    avaTOK.</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-tokens.10db3ea81bd0e151">One token has the unit value shown at checkout</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.cac0de0cbba0ed00">. That rate is fixed:
    That rate is fixed: it is the rate used to price features, to convert a top-up into tokens, and
    to work out what an unused balance is worth when you withdraw it.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.4a0f3375019da00e">3. Top-ups convert into tokens</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.117ce634f0e11944">
    When you top up, the amount you pay is converted into tokens at the fixed rate shown at checkout
    and credited to your wallet. Once
    converted, the balance is expressed and used in tokens.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.03ce25f63ccbba37">4. What tokens are not</h2>
  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.064c8ea7c5081365">A token has a fixed value of ₹1 for pricing on avaTOK and for working out what an unused
      balance is worth when it is withdrawn. Beyond that, a token is</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-tokens.254bb97b57f12e16">not</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.bbb7de02c0d3ace1">a deposit,
      not a bank balance, not e-money or a payment instrument, not a security or investment, and not
      a cryptocurrency or virtual digital asset. Tokens do not earn interest, they cannot be
      transferred to another person's account, and they carry no ownership or profit rights in
      either company. They are spendable only inside avaTOK — the one way to take value out is a
      withdrawal under</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.aba115e7791e41dc" href="/payouts">Payouts &amp; Withdrawals</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.2d7e1becd574e00d">5. What tokens can be spent on</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-tokens.3c517bfd974a0728">AI features</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.7ae6440f28802ea4">inside the app.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-tokens.e4217489094b217b">Marketplace purchases</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.a96047ecabce53ff">— digital services offered by other users.</ui-copy></li>
    <li><strong data-i18n="web-tokens.8963a054f93d7fb1">Consultations</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.3a8976988625de5c">— live consultancy sessions you book on the platform.</ui-copy></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.2e716911cafcc8e1">The token cost of a feature or service is shown before you confirm. Costs may change over time;
    see</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.3d0dc09fb719f670">. Some features may be unavailable in some
    countries, or may be turned off temporarily.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.9a73adec8a3cb11d">6. Your balance</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.4dfe4ad976f490b7">
    Your current token balance and recent activity are shown in the app. Please check your balance
    and transaction history regularly and tell us promptly if something looks wrong.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.43f5ccc072922137">7. Correcting balance errors</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.2fbb632078d10c19">We may adjust a balance to correct a technical error, a duplicate credit, a failed or reversed
    payment, a chargeback, or credit issued in error or obtained through abuse of a promotion. Where
    we make an adjustment, we will normally record it in your transaction history. If you disagree
    with an adjustment, contact</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.e9f0368e8a1fe58e">8. Withdrawing unused tokens</h2>
  <p>
    <strong data-i18n="web-tokens.5a445fae04b07d37">Unused tokens may be withdrawn.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.bec44f41c04e0467">They convert back at the same fixed rate — 1
    token value shown at checkout — subject to verification and to any transfer fee and tax shown at
    the time of withdrawal. Payouts go to a verified payout method, and applicable taxes may apply.
    The full rules are on the</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-tokens.aba115e7791e41dc" href="/payouts">Payouts &amp; Withdrawals</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.2c0560d6168d330b">page.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.cccf553401740e24">Tokens already spent are consumed and cannot be withdrawn. Refund rules are set out in</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-tokens.9990ef8acf0108bc" href="/refunds">Refunds &amp; Cancellations</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.d8d3e886b829938f">9. Suspension and account closure</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.2454ada2006f140b">If your account is suspended — for example while we investigate suspected fraud, a chargeback,
    or a breach of our</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.7c7dc7f79f15372c">— we may temporarily prevent you from
    spending or withdrawing your balance while the matter is reviewed.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.56abf3d90396cd79">
    If you close your account, or if we terminate it, you may ask us to withdraw any remaining
    unused balance, subject to verification, the applicable fee, any tax, and any amount we are
    entitled to set off or are required by law to withhold. We may decline to release a balance
    where doing so would be unlawful, or where the balance is linked to fraud or to a breach of our
    Terms.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.64f27aa0e9f4ee7f">10. Expiry</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.943bee7505abf4b4">
    Tokens do not carry an expiry date under this policy. If that ever changes, we will say so here
    and give notice in the app before it takes effect.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.f5007dc76b66f358">11. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-tokens.73ee27295f2ed9be">
    We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated version here and revise
    the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-tokens.5adadc207219605c">12. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.e78a42d87fca5d2c">Wallet, billing, and payout questions:</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.1170495b6bb2a942">. General enquiries:</ui-copy>
    <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.bf2fb03dedc02906">. See also our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-tokens.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-tokens.6201111b83a0cb5b">and</ui-copy> <a data-i18n="web-tokens.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
